select k.id, 9, 'Sign & Sky platform', 'AI-calculated score (0–10): the Sign & Sky AI compared the farmers'' prediction with historical recorded scientific weather data for Wolaita.', '2025-06-10', 'Traditional Knowledge Systems & Microclimate Indicators — Indigenous Weather Forecasting, Wolaita, South Ethiopia. Sign & Sky farmer field record, 2025 (indigenous_wolaita.pdf).', 'Recorded in the field table as: Ants carrying eggs uphill; date(s): 10 June 2025.'
